# Consent + CSP

## Consent (do not “simplify”)
- **Consent Mode v2 (Advanced, region defaults):** before any `gtag('config')` (`BaseLayout.astro` + `src/lib/gdprRegions.ts`):
  - **EEA / UK / CH** (`region: GDPR_CONSENT_REGION_CODES`): default `denied` for `ad_storage`, `ad_user_data`, `ad_personalization`, and `analytics_storage`.
  - **Everywhere else:** default `analytics_storage: granted`; keep `ad_storage` / `ad_user_data` / `ad_personalization` **denied** until Accept (AdSense-safe). Owner decision 2026-11-27 (Sidney): non-CMP regions must not ship analytics denied-by-default (that produced `gcs=G100` and near-zero GA4 users).
- Always load `gtag.js` so Consent Mode / cookieless pings work; never gate script load on Accept.
- **EEA / UK / CH:** Google Funding Choices / AdSense Privacy & messaging is the **only** CMP UI. Suppress the first-party cookie bar. Google’s CMP updates consent via TCF; do not use the site Accept path.
- **Elsewhere:** site cookie bar with Accept + **Reject / Do not sell or share**. Accept → grant analytics + ads + `page_view`. Reject → `consent update` denied for analytics and ads, remember `yc_cookie_ok=0`. No prior choice → analytics stays at the granted default; ads stay denied. Honor prior `yc_cookie_ok` (`1` grant / `0` deny). Preference UI also on `/cookies/` (`src/pages/cookies.astro`).
- **GA4 ID:** `PUBLIC_GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID` or hardcoded `DEFAULT_GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID` (`G-N4VRDDEVLP`) so builds without the env still emit tracking.
- Geo signal: Worker injects `<meta name="yt-geo-country">` from `request.cf.country` / `CF-IPCountry` (`src/worker.ts`, `src/lib/htmlGeoInject.ts`). Consent Mode `region` list is the primary default split; CF country drives banner UX.
- Privacy + cookies copy must stay aligned with this geo policy (`src/pages/privacy.astro`, `src/pages/cookies.astro`, `docs/ADSENSE.md`).

## CSP (`public/_headers`)
Keep the allowlist **narrow**. Comment in `_headers` explains each host. Required families:

| Hosts | Why |
|---|---|
| `googletagmanager.com`, `google-analytics.com`, `*.g.doubleclick.net`, `*.google.com` | GA4 / Google Signals |
| `*.googlesyndication.com`, `*.adtrafficquality.google`, `fundingchoicesmessages.google.com` | AdSense + Funding Choices CMP |
| `fonts.googleapis.com`, `fonts.gstatic.com` | Funding Choices UI fonts/styles |
| `static.cloudflareinsights.com`, `cloudflareinsights.com` | Cloudflare Web Analytics |

**Do not** loosen to `*` / broad CDNs “just in case”. Add a host only with a named product reason and a matching comment. CSP changes are their own careful PR — never casual drive-bys.
